d 'XTCSDDIAG': module to compute residual diagnostics for heterogeneous panels with cross-sectional dependence: serial correlation, heteroskedasticity, normality and parameter stability
d
d    The residual tests in common use for panels (for example
d xtserial, xttest3, xtqptest) are built for fixed-effects models
d with	  homogeneous slopes and assume that the units are
d independent. With common factors in the errors, as in most macro
d panels, they	  over-reject, and they cannot be applied to the
d unit regressions of mean-group or common correlated effects (CCE)
d estimators.	 xtcsddiag fits the model unit by unit, tests the
d residuals of each unit, and combines the unit results. 
d
d KW: panel data
d KW: residuals
d KW: common factors
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261110
d
d Author:  Yusuf Toyin Yusuf,  Kwara State University
d Support: email  YUSUF.YUSUF@@KWASU.EDU.NG
d
f xtcsddiag.ado
f xtcsddiag.sthlp
f xtcdmax.ado
f xtcdmax.sthlp
f xtcollin.ado
f xtcollin.sthlp
f xtcsddiag_apec.dta
f xtcsddiag_example.do
f ../_/_xtcdmax_display.ado
f ../_/_xtcdmax_load.ado
f ../_/_xtcdmax_mata.ado
f ../_/_xtcollin_display.ado
f ../_/_xtcollin_load.ado
f ../_/_xtcollin_mata.ado
f ../_/_xtcsddiag_display.ado
f ../_/_xtcsddiag_load.ado
f ../_/_xtcsddiag_mata.ado
